# A failed Face ID leaves it off in the profile; at login, it leaves the shopper on the login screen.
login-as bob
tab profile
face-id on
device biometry fail
expect faceID=off error=biometryFailed prompt=none
face-id on
device biometry match
logout
confirm
face-id
device biometry fail
expect screen=auth/login error=biometryFailed prompt=none
